---
description: Tests as contract — TDD where applicable, CI gate
globs:
  - "engineering/**"
  - "**/*test*"
  - "**/*spec*"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Dev tests

- New behavior → tests in the same change set when feasible.
- Treat tests as contract for public APIs and critical paths.
- Do not disable or skip tests to make CI green without documented reason.
- Prefer existing test framework and patterns in `engineering/src/`.

When generating from OpenAPI/spec, include unit tests for DTO validation and main branches.
